{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33234","headline":"观山灯献徐尚书 二 · 温庭皓","name":"观山灯献徐尚书 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九枝应并耀，午夜忽潜然。\n景集青山外，萤分碧草前。\n辉华侵月影，历乱写星躔。\n望极高楼上，摇光满绮筵。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"温庭皓","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33234.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33234","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}